{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lost Skies: Island Creator</strong> allows you to create your very own island for the upcoming co-op survival game Lost Skies. Create your own sky island full of stunning vistas and brutal enemies, then release it into the world via the Steam Workshop!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>  </strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Lost_Skies_Island_Creator_GIF_1.gif?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>Create Your Own Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Lost Skies: Island Creator is a free standalone tool where you can create the island of your dreams or your friend\u2019s nightmares. Form the basic look of your island using simple geometric shapes, then sculpt away until you get your island looking exactly how you imagined it. Want a giant cave system or mountain range going through the island? You can do it!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Lost_Skies_Island_Creator_GIF_2.gif?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate Your Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a beautiful island filled with lush forests and stunning vistas or an island full of mystery and danger littered with foreboding caves full of dense fog and dangerous ruins filled with enemies and traps. No matter what you choose, you will be able to bring your island to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Lost_Skies_Island_Creator_GIF_3.gif?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Puzzles and Add Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every island is peaceful. Add dangerous threats such as enemy drones or create puzzles for players to solve to find treasure. How hostile (and rewarding) you make your island is up to you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Lost_Skies_Island_Creator_Gif_4.gif?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Share Your Island with the World!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After you\u2019ve put the finishing touches on your island, upload it to the Steam Workshop for other players to explore! Change your mind? You can freely edit and re-upload your island as often as you\u2019d like for everyone to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Lost_Skies_Island_Creator_GIF_5.gif?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Join_us_now.png?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Discord to join the active Lost Skies community filled with creative visionaries and eager explorers who are helping to shape the future of the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2102670?t=1750175214","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750175214","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/84c495b2fd89524ea5f3d50ef0fab0185b2c18cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750175214","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/84c495b2fd89524ea5f3d50ef0fab0185b2c18cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750175214","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lost Skies: Island Creator</strong> allows you to create your very own island for the upcoming co-op survival game Lost Skies. Create your own sky island full of stunning vistas and brutal enemies, then release it into the world via the Steam Workshop!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>  </strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Lost_Skies_Island_Creator_GIF_1.gif?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>Create Your Own Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Lost Skies: Island Creator is a free standalone tool where you can create the island of your dreams or your friend\u2019s nightmares. Form the basic look of your island using simple geometric shapes, then sculpt away until you get your island looking exactly how you imagined it. Want a giant cave system or mountain range going through the island? You can do it!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Lost_Skies_Island_Creator_GIF_2.gif?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate Your Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a beautiful island filled with lush forests and stunning vistas or an island full of mystery and danger littered with foreboding caves full of dense fog and dangerous ruins filled with enemies and traps. No matter what you choose, you will be able to bring your island to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Lost_Skies_Island_Creator_GIF_3.gif?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Puzzles and Add Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every island is peaceful. Add dangerous threats such as enemy drones or create puzzles for players to solve to find treasure. How hostile (and rewarding) you make your island is up to you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Lost_Skies_Island_Creator_Gif_4.gif?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Share Your Island with the World!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After you\u2019ve put the finishing touches on your island, upload it to the Steam Workshop for other players to explore! Change your mind? You can freely edit and re-upload your island as often as you\u2019d like for everyone to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Lost_Skies_Island_Creator_GIF_5.gif?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/extras/Join_us_now.png?t=1750175214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Discord to join the active Lost Skies community filled with creative visionaries and eager explorers who are helping to shape the future of the game!</p>","developers":["Bossa Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102670/e255bcd0140e1229063e9d6111470136ad1bdce7/header.jpg?t=1750175214","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Developed and published by Bossa Studios Ltd. Lost Skies, Bossa Studios, Bossa Games and their respective logos and marks are trademarks of Bossa Studios Ltd.\u200e All rights reserved. \u00a9 2024<br />\r\n\u00a9 2024 Humble Bundle and Humble Games are among the registered trademarks of Ziff Davis LLC, parent company of Humble Bundle Inc. throughout the world. All rights reserved. Any unauthorized use of such trademarks is expressly prohibited.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257077115,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077115/movie480.mp4?t=1733320646","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077115/movie_max.mp4?t=1733320646"},"name":"Island Creator Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257077115/22d7123d7208527062de5665b230b653e449d3d1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1733320646","webm":{"480":"http://video.ak